<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,500&display=swap">

<div class="lxo-page">
  <header class="lxo-bar">
    <div class="lxo-bar-row">
      <a class="lxo-word" href="#top">LURVOX</a>
      <a class="lxo-login" href="https://app.lurvox.in/login">Client login</a>
    </div>
    <p class="lxo-highlight">Online fitness coaching</p>
  </header>

  <div id="lxo-browse">
    <main id="top">
      <section class="lxo-hero">
        <figure class="lxo-hero-photo" id="lxo-hero-photo">
          <img class="is-on" data-scene="gym" src="{{ 'lurvox-white-hero.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Woman walking through a bright white gym" width="1536" height="1024">
          <img data-scene="train" src="{{ 'lurvox-white-train.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Man doing a cable row in a bright studio" width="1536" height="1024">
          <img data-scene="eat" src="{{ 'lurvox-white-eat.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A plate of chicken, rice, and greens on a white counter" width="1536" height="1024">
          <img data-scene="checkin" src="{{ 'lurvox-white-checkin.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Woman by a bright window with a phone for her check-in" width="1536" height="1024">
        </figure>
        <div class="lxo-scenes" role="tablist" aria-label="The story of the plan">
          <button type="button" role="tab" data-scene="gym" class="is-on" aria-selected="true">Start</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" data-scene="train" aria-selected="false">Workout</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" data-scene="eat" aria-selected="false">Diet</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" data-scene="checkin" aria-selected="false">Check-in</button>
        </div>
        <p class="lxo-beat" id="lxo-beat">1 of 4 · The start</p>
        <h1>A plan written for one person.</h1>
        <p class="lxo-lede" id="lxo-hero-lede">Most plans are a template. This one starts with your goal, your day, and where you train.</p>
        <button type="button" class="lxo-quiz" data-lxo-start>Find the plan that fits</button>
      </section>

      <section class="lxo-shots lxo-reveal" id="lxo-shots">
        <p class="lxo-kicker">What you get</p>
        <h2>A workout, a diet, and a coach who changes both.</h2>
        <p class="lxo-intro">The three parts are written for the same week. Open each one.</p>
        <article class="lxo-shot is-open">
          <button type="button" data-shot="train">01 · The workout</button>
          <p class="lxo-shot-line">Sessions set for the time you have, at home or in a gym.</p>
          <div class="lxo-shot-body">
            <div>
              <img src="{{ 'lurvox-white-train.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Man doing a cable row in a bright studio" width="1536" height="1024">
              <p>You say where you train and how long a session can be. The coach writes the sets for that, not from a copied program.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="lxo-shot">
          <button type="button" data-shot="eat">02 · The diet</button>
          <p class="lxo-shot-line">Meals from food you will actually eat.</p>
          <div class="lxo-shot-body">
            <div>
              <img src="{{ 'lurvox-white-eat.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A plate of chicken, rice, and greens on a white counter" width="1536" height="1024">
              <p>The diet is built around your kitchen and your day. When you log what you ate, the next version is adjusted from that.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="lxo-shot">
          <button type="button" data-shot="checkin">03 · The check-in</button>
          <p class="lxo-shot-line">You report. The plan is rewritten from what you did.</p>
          <div class="lxo-shot-body">
            <div>
              <img src="{{ 'lurvox-white-checkin.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Woman by a bright window with a phone for her check-in" width="1536" height="1024">
              <p>A short check-in in the app, plus chat with your coach. The next plan comes from the week you had, not from a guess.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="lxo-steps lxo-reveal">
        <img class="lxo-wide" src="{{ 'lurvox-white-write.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Coach writing a plan at a white desk" width="1536" height="1024">
        <p class="lxo-kicker">After you join</p>
        <h2>You are not handed a file and left alone.</h2>
        <p class="lxo-intro">This is the order. Tap a step.</p>
        <ol id="lxo-next">
          <li>
            <button type="button" class="is-on">
              <span>01</span>
              <p><strong>You tell the coach your week.</strong> Goal, schedule, food, and where you train. A few questions, not a form you disappear into.</p>
            </button>
          </li>
          <li>
            <button type="button">
              <span>02</span>
              <p><strong>A coach writes the plan.</strong> The workout and the diet are for that life. Nothing is copied from a template and sent as-is.</p>
            </button>
          </li>
          <li>
            <button type="button">
              <span>03</span>
              <p><strong>You follow it, then it changes.</strong> Check in on what you did. The next week is harder or easier for a reason.</p>
            </button>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="lxo-list lxo-reveal" id="plans">
        <p class="lxo-kicker">The choice</p>
        <h2>How long should the coach stay?</h2>
        <p class="lxo-intro">Every plan includes the workout, the diet, check-ins, and chat. A longer plan is rewritten more often.</p>
        <div class="lxo-plan-list" id="lxo-plan-list">
          <button type="button" data-plan="fat" class="is-on">
            <div>
              <strong>Fat loss</strong>
              <span>90 days</span>
            </div>
            <em>₹1,999</em>
          </button>
          <button type="button" data-plan="muscle">
            <div>
              <strong>Muscle</strong>
              <span>6 months · weekly revisions, cardio, supplements</span>
            </div>
            <em>₹3,499</em>
          </button>
          <button type="button" data-plan="athletic">
            <div>
              <strong>Athletic</strong>
              <span>12 months · the full plan, including stamina</span>
            </div>
            <em>₹5,999</em>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="lxo-plan-more" id="lxo-plan-more">
          <p class="lxo-plan-why" id="lxo-plan-why">90 days to lose fat. The plan is rewritten every 14 days, from your check-ins.</p>
          <p id="lxo-plan-month">90 days · ₹666 a month</p>
          <ul id="lxo-plan-points">
            <li>Workout and diet for 90 days</li>
            <li>Check-ins and chat in the app</li>
            <li>Rewritten every 14 days</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="lxo-intro">Three questions. The quiz picks the plan, then a coach writes it for your week.</p>
        <button type="button" class="lxo-quiz" data-lxo-start>Find the plan that fits</button>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <section class="lxo-ask" id="lxo-ask" hidden>
    <div class="lxo-progress" id="lxo-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
    <p class="lxo-step" id="lxo-step">1 of 3</p>
    <h1 id="lxo-question">What do you want from this?</h1>
    <div class="lxo-options" id="lxo-options"></div>
    <button type="button" class="lxo-back" id="lxo-back" hidden>Back</button>

    <div id="lxo-result" hidden>
      <p class="lxo-length">Your plan</p>
      <h1 id="lxo-result-name">Fat loss</h1>
      <p class="lxo-price" id="lxo-result-price">₹1,999</p>
      <p class="lxo-lede" id="lxo-result-why"></p>
      <a class="lxo-quiz" id="lxo-continue" href="https://app.lurvox.in/plans/3-months">Continue with this plan</a>
      <button type="button" class="lxo-back" id="lxo-again">Answer again</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="lxo-foot">
    <strong>LURVOX</strong>
    <p>Online fitness coaching</p>
    <p>14, Sector 44, Golf Course Road, Gurugram, Haryana 122003</p>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@lurvox.in">hello@lurvox.in</a>
      <a href="https://app.lurvox.in/terms">Terms</a>
      <a href="https://app.lurvox.in/refund-policy">Refund policy</a>
    </p>
  </footer>

  <div class="lxo-sticky" id="lxo-sticky" hidden>
    <button type="button" class="lxo-quiz" data-lxo-start>Find the plan that fits</button>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  html:has(.lxo-page),
